    "group": "Sisters of Battle Immolator",
    "summary": "Room for 6 models, and only ORDO HERETICUS INFANTRY models may embark. As you begin Declare Battle Formations, you may pick one of your SISTERS OF BATTLE SQUAD units and separate it into two units as close to equal in size as possible, noting which models make up each. One of the two must begin the battle embarked in this model; the other may begin embarked in a different TRANSPORT or be set up on its own.",
